WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.569
-♪ W-W-Whoa, w-whoa ♪

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:05.838
-This one goes out to anyone
who's ever been left waiting.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:08.208
-We feel you.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.775
-♪ W-W-Whoa, w-whoa ♪

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:11.577
♪ I just found
the funniest meme ♪

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.213
♪ With the most adorable dog
that I've ever seen ♪

00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:15.682
♪ So I text it to my friends ♪

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:20.220
♪ Saying "OMG literally me RN,"
then send ♪

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.988
♪ Now they're
typing something back ♪

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:24.790
♪ Still typing something back ♪

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.260
♪ I just wanna know
what you thought ♪

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.061 line:0%
♪ But all you said
was three dots ♪

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:31.931 line:0%
♪ So I update my laptop ♪
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.266 line:0%
-♪ Watch a couple TikToks ♪
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:35.501 line:0%
-♪ Play hopscotch
with street chalk ♪

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.337 line:0%
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:39.606 line:0%
-♪ Stitch a cozy for my teapot ♪
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:42.041
-♪ My girl been writing back so
long that I been wiggin' out ♪

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.610
♪ Like 15 minutes, man, I wonder
what she writin' 'bout ♪

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.046
♪ Gotta know what the text
is gonna be ♪

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:50.250
♪ It's like little bubbles
making fun of me ♪

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.718
♪ Baby, hit "send" quickly ♪

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:55.121
♪ 'Cause I can't take
these ellipses ♪

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.323
♪ Every text from you
gets me so hot ♪

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.158
♪ Now all I got is three dots ♪

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:01.894 line:0%
♪ So I practice my jump shot ♪
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

00:01:01.894 --> 00:01:04.030 line:0%
-♪ Dance to the beat drop ♪
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.633 line:0%
-♪ Make a plan to win an EGOT ♪
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.001 line:0%
-♪ Watch "The Office"
on Peacock ♪

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:09.469 line:0%
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:11.704 line:0%
-♪ I appreciate taking your time
to respond ♪

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.006
♪ But while you've been texting,
we wrote a whole song ♪

00:01:14.006 --> 00:01:16.809
-♪ About waiting and waiting,
it's almost too much ♪

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:20.279
♪ You could at least give
my last text a thumbs-up ♪

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.715
♪ But the text on three dots ♪

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.951
♪ Gray and bouncy three dots ♪

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:27.620 line:0%
♪ 'Bout to yell it
from the treetops ♪

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.455 line:0%
♪ 'Cause the text
on three dots ♪

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:30.990
[ Cellphone chimes ]
-Oh. Ah.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.125
-Yeah, okay, yeah.

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.226
-Nice.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:35.662
-♪ Text still three dots ♪

